      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419c98766bc5beb757dec6b6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可恶可恶可恶！！完全不在\r\n状态……！——啊！？看什么看\r\n混蛋！别管我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "570384bcb333e0fffb4ef7ff64423e3a5a36fa72674a94125426d02c11588e3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c8cf44dd41a4ae62151d35",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——……。\r\n……啊？……没事。啥也没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f929d86927b39aa642d292f702a18c3e8e6207e5cd3bc292fbb0bc52929e8c93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a23b8f3f8281f7a6b01f110",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂混蛋，不是塞得越多越好！\r\n这点道理，你应该明白的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d90c473324f31793750fd81906d080d321add5c3625836107363ee201845aef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4d8e2526fe7f21ae0b0cb7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然跑了那就是奔着赢去的……\r\n但是……混蛋，你完事了给我等着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "721d5fcf05e6af6f09924b2b7904e6662a19269f4210a8a3236023124d2cfdfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a997efdbac53a32cc185739",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，状态完美！\r\n我已经没什么好怕的了！\r\n把他们全干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef18ff97b9e29b49f5cf298f5677b4c15454a713f1714c154d44dbc900d45ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c901fed4d7e9834b40e80cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老妈也在看着。\r\n今天就让她见识一下我超强的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5cc693bc402eb9154d8ac3470f9caa90f6fb9cde2f7562caa0084eb9e0697a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a15fe9f0c818e5d97aa5fd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "厉害了……感觉有一股超强的力量\r\n涌上来了！我这……\r\n今天不是要牛逼炸了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e3fc3e88191a0c2218e05c92b70268c915b66bbb53dc8613c14a0911f07ba4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f182d9266cf943c67a25c4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然那帮家伙看起来都干劲十足……\r\n但哼，这种程度是不可能吓到我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "291838368ff44cd8a2e505f0ed800762e574bd65f8971daa7d102ef15fec79d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ba1861491ff7fd50549553",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蹄铁完美。早饭也吃得饱饱的。\r\n作战也和你练得妥妥的！\r\n好嘞，老子没有弱点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c116306343c1b657dff1c9c17bb1186222fd3b85067736da6cd6ee7e05482e16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce47f39fb1e4f6e2e0f8ed34",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管是对手还是那帮观众，\r\n全都要让他们明白——\r\n老子才是最强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67a6c273cf9ddefef1e31d83ca962a338628719004814892cba4cdae56faf64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e20944e778b1dfb3feaba2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上吧。\r\n要用谁都挑不出毛病的奔跑！\r\n把那些瞧不起我的家伙全闭嘴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da302d886c62ebb3250eb8f978c5d92f6e4e3faba37cd481c61357d73d90ae88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1081/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d625e7f91e7815b2101a26",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要相信做过的一切就好。\r\n我很强，变强了，绝对能行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d88b250b17e9e2a742c464da0cc3bbd97b3660ef9a7a5670cb8cea53aaccc534",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
