      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……没问题吧，我……。\r\n～～切，快说没问题啊！\r\n这样我才能……给他们点颜色看啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28417cf396e72690343023da078db87b262e58324a408e8bed1887f1ab5c1b91",
